WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.982
Today every sentence is a question. The answer is yes, or no.

2
00:00:04.432 --> 00:00:11.244
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.744 --> 00:00:14.324
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:14.824 --> 00:00:20.296
First, tell your child one word. No. It is on the page today, and it is not sounded out.

5
00:00:20.746 --> 00:00:22.865
Your child reads the question out loud.

6
00:00:23.265 --> 00:00:25.871
Can a bed hop? No, a bed does not hop.

7
00:00:26.571 --> 00:00:31.842
Ask: can that be? To answer, your child has to see it. And then your child circles no.

8
00:00:32.292 --> 00:00:37.977
Then ask: how do you know? One reason is enough. It is the reason that shows the understanding.

9
00:00:38.427 --> 00:00:42.991
If the answer is wrong, do not correct it. Say: read it again. What do you see?

10
00:00:43.441 --> 00:00:45.568
Do both questions of job one together.

11
00:00:46.018 --> 00:00:52.229
For job two, press play on the listening track and step away. The voice waits, then reads each question.

12
00:00:52.679 --> 00:00:59.269
Your child marks the box, then goes back and circles yes or no. The page says how many of each there are.

13
00:00:59.719 --> 00:01:03.508
At the end, your child reads one question to you, and answers it.
